# This repository versions ONLY the game-re reverse-engineering agent system.
# Everything else in ~/.claude (credentials, sessions, memory, settings,
# history) is private runtime state and must never be tracked.
#
# Whitelist pattern: ignore everything, then opt in specific paths.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md

!/agents
/agents/*
!/agents/game-re.md

!/skills
/skills/*
!/skills/re-codebreaker
!/skills/re-oracle
!/skills/re-learn
